sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Service client
    participant API as Django ASGI adapter
    participant Redis as Shared rate-limit cache
    participant App as IngestTrade application service
    participant Store as Thread-sensitive ORM transaction
    participant Domain as Decimal domain logic
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST with Bearer token and decimal strings
    API->>API: Authenticate configured service token
    API->>Redis: Atomic rate-limit counter
    Redis-->>API: Allow or limit
    API->>API: Validate finite positive values and supported quote
    API->>App: Ingest validated trade
    App->>Store: sync_to_async transaction boundary
    Store->>Domain: Assess risk and calculate exact notional
    Domain-->>Store: Risk assessment and notional
    Store->>DB: Persist or check exchange_id + trade_id
    DB-->>Store: New row, identical replay, or conflict
    Store-->>App: Result
    App-->>API: Result
    API-->>Client: 201 new / 200 replay / 409 conflict
